WEBVTT

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:10.190
<b>Episode 17: The Hero and the Children</b>

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.620
They've changed shape again.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.100
This is bad.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.020
They're starting to get intense.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.480
If they evolve any further 
than this, we'll be in trouble.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:30.130
Doesn't the one in the very 
center feel different?

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:34.270
Strike first!

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:35.740
Wait, Asahina!

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:41.680
Huh?!

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:42.880
Ma—

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:45.850
Magical Marie?!

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:50.320
Magical...

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.280
Pudding Knife!

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.030
Order to all Knights!

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:03.330
Don't die!

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>When I looked up, 
that sky was full of wonders.</i>

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:27.790
<i>The despair I bottled up tormented me,</i>

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:31.760
<i>and I wanted the courage 
to break my chains of isolation.</i>

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:33.030
<i>(You are my light)</i>

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:38.620
<i>I was searching for your 
brilliant light in my hazy dreams</i>

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:42.920
<i>to kick away the limits placed on myself.</i>

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:47.880
<i>Now with your courage, 
let’s soar into the sky.</i>

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:50.590
<i>Let's CRUSH the fear!</i>

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:55.730
<i>I swear to you, at the ends 
of this chaotic world,</i>

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:58.270
<i>that even if you fall, I'll</i>

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:00.820
<i>Be the HERO!</i>

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:05.880
<i>I'll be waiting at the future 
we're moving toward,</i>

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:09.830
<i>with a “YES, MY LORD!” 
for your constant radiance,</i>

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:13.840
<i>clutching the stars raining down upon us.</i>

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:21.580
<i>I'll love you until we reach 
that future you want to destroy.</i>

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:40.010
Subaru-chan!

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:42.140
Yuki!

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:54.440
I'm alone?

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:58.150
They did a great job splitting us up.

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:04.980
Welp, we're in trouble now.

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:08.720
I have to join up with the others quickly.

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:09.540
All right.

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:12.570
Come forth, Freitag!

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:17.660
It's okay.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:21.290
I'll be fine, Tarou-kun.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.570
Yuki, nice job!

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:26.640
Great job grabbing me!

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:27.830
Yeah.

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:29.910
I'm glad we didn't get separated.

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:32.250
Y-Yeah.

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:45.530
Magical Marie.

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:50.160
Th-That's the eleventh golem that transforms?

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:51.640
Damn it.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:55.330
It's planning to take on two Mythic Beast 
Knights and the Princess at the same time?

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:56.970
However...

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:57.880
Hakudou!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:01.260
Leave this to me and Asahina while 
you search out and aid the others!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:02.570
R-Right!

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:12.120
Drill Kick!

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:23.690
Never imagined I'd get to fight Marie.

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:25.070
Don't let your guard down.

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:26.870
We don't know what it'll transform into.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.790
Hmph. Like I'd bother actually facing them.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:39.210
You've gotten much nimbler.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:40.220
Yeah.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:42.980
I trained up quite a bit 
these past six months.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:45.010
All right, let's look for the others!

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:49.430
And there!

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:51.490
Oh!

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:57.420
I was able to catch the kids getting dragged 
off together before we were separated.

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.070
Let's go find them.

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:00.150
We have to save them.

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.960
Let's make a cool appearance!

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:04.170
Yeah.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:06.240
It's our chance to be heroes!

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:09.200
Unbreakable Shield!

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.000
Subaru-chan, you okay?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.880
My leg... I think I sprained it.

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:24.820
<i>Animus, are you holding back 
because I'm with them?</i>

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:28.480
Akane-kun, we have to find 
somewhere to hide fast.

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:29.550
Got it.

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:43.090
For now, let's rest here 
and consider our next move.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:50.020
<i>Will I have to watch these 
two die if they corner us?</i>

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:04.510
I could only stop three of them.

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:15.600
Hana-chan!

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:17.060
Hakudou-san!

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:20.420
Incredible.

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:22.390
The Mythic Beast Knights are impressive.

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:23.610
You saved me.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:27.030
But that took all of my power.

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:30.130
It looks like they've gotten a lot tougher.

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:32.600
Let's go.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:35.340
We need to get everyone back together.

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:46.270
Huh?!

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:00.770
You've done your research!

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:01.690
However!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.770
The Bottled Ship Incident 
and Father's Love Kick!

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.930
Bottled Ship?

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:10.300
My son broke it long ago.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:12.660
It doesn't bother me anymore.

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:23.560
<i>It's tough.</i>

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:28.260
<i>Its prowess, as well as its special ability, 
are fitting for the eleventh one.</i>

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.930
<i>On top of that, Asahina is weak 
against mental attacks.</i>

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:38.970
<i>Now, what do we do?</i>

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:48.500
Shimaki!

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:52.730
I wiped out all the nearby 
tenth golems and came back.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.030
Sorry I'm late!

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:57.220
Shimaki-san! What is that?!

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:58.490
It's so cool!

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:00.110
Perfect timing!

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:01.830
Let's finish this at once!

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:04.250
Go! Freitag!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.590
Subaru-chan?

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:11.780
This is bad.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:14.130
The pain keeps growing worse.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:18.560
<i>We can't run anymore with her like that.</i>

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:20.300
<i>She's guaranteed to die.</i>

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:22.390
It's all right, I'll carry you.

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:25.670
No. Then you won't be able to run.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:27.360
Leave me behind!

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.450
<i>Sacrificing herself?</i>

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.570
<i>Does she mean that?</i>

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:32.590
No!

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:33.800
You're going to be okay!

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:35.280
We'll all make it through!

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.180
Look at our situation first!

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:38.990
I'm saying this so we don't all die!

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:40.650
Don't talk about dying!

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:44.210
Think of what to do so 
we all make it through, Subaru-chan!

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:54.640
<i>Those two are serious.</i>

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:56.080
<i>I'm sure...</i>

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:59.610
<i>they'll both die.</i>

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:02.980
<i>Then what about me?</i>

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.590
<i>I won't die?</i>

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:06.250
<i>Really?</i>

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:08.730
<i>Can Animus be trusted?</i>

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:11.490
Taiyou. Calm down.

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:16.200
<i>Calm down. Calm down. Calm down.</i>

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:18.310
<i>I'll die?</i>

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:20.160
<i>That doesn't actually matter, does it?</i>

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:21.870
<i>It's fine.</i>

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:27.760
<i>Even if I do die, 
there's no one who needs me.</i>

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:31.210
<i>I'm longing for 
the destruction of this world.</i>

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:35.760
If I just sit patiently,

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.960
maybe I'll die without suffering.

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:42.390
What?

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:46.440
Don't give up so easily!

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:47.880
You're a man!

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.490
Say you want to live!

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:52.650
There's nothing good worth living for!

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:53.590
There is!

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:55.030
And if there isn't, then make it!

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:57.150
Make it?

00:09:57.150 --> 00:10:00.150
We'll survive, go home, 
 and we'll all eat ramen together!

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:05.070
I haven't seen your power yet, 
Akane-kun, but what is it?

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:11.340
My power, Pandora, 
is the ability to stir up time.

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:14.930
So it's only able to destroy golems 
that were just created.

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:17.670
It only turns back time a little bit.

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:19.270
Time?

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:21.140
Then maybe...

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:23.740
Akane-kun,

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:26.280
try using that power on Subaru-chan's leg!

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:27.810
Huh? Why?

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:29.070
Just do it!

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:33.770
Ahh, the pain is going away.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:36.310
I-It's healed?!

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:39.160
I never imagined it could be used this way.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:40.530
You did it!

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:42.430
It can heal?

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:46.200
All right! Now, let's all 
make it home together!

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:50.370
<i>No, our situation hasn't changed that much.</i>

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:53.790
<i>It's impossible to break through the horde 
of tenth golems with the three of us.</i>

00:10:54.810 --> 00:10:58.080
<i>Though now I'm starting to think 
I don't want to die, either.</i>

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:10.270
<i>W-We're done for.</i>

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:12.180
Huh?!

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.630
Are all three of you okay?!

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:16.310
Sorry for the wait, kids!

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:17.940
We're here to save you!

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:24.540
All three of you did well.

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:28.700
Now, then.

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.820
Shall we go ahead and do the thing?

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:33.600
It's our turn now, you know.

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:35.150
We should do it as a courtesy.

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:36.490
Courtesy to who?

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:38.630
Isn't that obvious?

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.390
Obvious?

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.770
Yeah... Guess we should then.

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:47.060
The heroes...

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:49.060
have arrived!

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:57.220
Hey! Wait, Yuu-kun, we're not fighting?

00:11:57.220 --> 00:11:59.600
Even after we made our cool appearance?!

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:01.400
Are we heading somewhere specific?

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.700
It's just over there!

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:07.210
Everyone, go wide around and get behind me!

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:15.750
A-A pitfall?

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:21.670
Yeah!

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:22.720
Yuki!

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:23.580
Yeah!

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:27.600
Unstoppable Spear!

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:28.700
That cut a lot of them down!

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:29.710
Let's finish off the rest!

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:32.300
Aw, yeah!

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.240
W-We're safe?

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:55.350
Hakudou-san, are you all right?!

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:58.060
I-I'm fine.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:03.090
We have to find everyone else quickly.

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:05.020
Let's go back for now.

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:07.340
If we haven't found them 
after looking this much,

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:10.550
then they might have 
already rejoined the others.

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:12.140
That's true.

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:15.970
Plus we can't let you 
exhaust yourself any further.

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:18.810
Yeah, I'm starting to get dizzy.

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:26.960
Even with three of us, it's not enough?

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:30.090
Shimaki! Is the next golem ready?

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:33.640
I'm sorry. 
I can't just create it immediately.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:35.490
I'll run away when I can.

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:41.020
Hey.

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:43.210
Nice work, Maimakterion.

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:44.670
Animus!

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:47.570
Let's call it a day now.

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:48.620
Roger.

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:53.220
All the Pyanepsion on this 
mountain have been destroyed.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:57.230
Man, that snake girl sure is strong.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.940
Hakudou did?

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.970
Let's play, once it recovers again.

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:05.460
See you later, Beast Knights.

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:11.520
<i>The ones on this mountain were wiped out?</i>

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:15.290
<i>Once it recovers again?</i>

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:20.250
Thank goodness. Everyone's safe.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.610
Yay!

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:23.630
Things were pretty dicey this time.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:24.610
Yeah.

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:26.650
You all did well to overcome this crisis.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:29.790
Nagumo-san, about the tenth.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:30.830
What is it?

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:35.520
After Animus mentioned 
recovering, I'm certain.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:39.820
That horde as a whole is one single golem.

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:45.820
That's why he described them replenishing 
their lost numbers as recovering.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:50.580
We probably need to attack it until its HP 
reaches zero just like all the others.

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:53.700
But no matter how many times we fight it, 
it doesn't go down to zero.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.450
We're missing one?

00:14:55.450 --> 00:15:00.770
No, Animus said that all the ones 
on this mountain were eliminated.

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:01.970
Which means...

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:06.510
There's a tiny golem that's hiding
 instead of going to battle?

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:08.050
Most likely.

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:14.810
<i>The power to heal?</i>

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:24.380
<i>Could I have healed him?</i>

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:25.610
<i>Back then...</i>

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:29.110
<i>Kusakabe-san...</i>

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:31.360
<i>Did I...</i>

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:37.730
<i>let him die?</i>

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:39.780
Hmm? What's wrong?

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:42.540
Oh, nothing.

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:45.630
I'm glad you survived this time, too.

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:55.300
I'm going home. Later.

00:15:56.960 --> 00:16:00.390
Where is the tiny one 
that avoids battle hiding?

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:03.330
I'd hide under a bed if it were me.

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:06.500
I wonder where Animus even sleeps.

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:09.780
We can't let our battle against 
the tenth draw out any longer.

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:11.880
We have to do something to defeat it.

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:13.900
Or next time someone will die.

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:15.980
<i>Die...</i>

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:19.560
Loki...

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:23.580
Last time the Owl Knight sided 
with Animus, as well, right?

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:24.670
Yes.

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:27.560
What happened to him in the end?

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:31.580
At the end of the last battle, 
he turned traitor.

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:32.930
Against the Beast Knights?

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:35.260
No, against Animus.

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:39.970
Once all the Knights were defeated, and
he finished off the final one, the Dog Knight,

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:42.920
he finally gained Animus' trust.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:45.270
Then when Animus turned his back...

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:49.690
Yet Animus countered, and he died.

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:52.870
I was completely surprised, as well.

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:57.570
He had sacrificed everything else 
in his act of siding with Animus,

00:16:57.570 --> 00:17:00.290
all for that one chance.

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:03.030
I don't want to go through that again.

00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:04.680
Watching my Knight,

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:05.950
my friend,

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:09.550
get killed so brutally.

00:17:10.910 --> 00:17:12.090
Taiyou...

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:15.540
That's why I don't want to force you 
to fight a losing battle.

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:18.170
No matter what else 
I may have to sacrifice...

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:23.420
However, if you find yourself 
drawn to the Beast Knights

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:26.060
and wish for a future 
other than destruction,

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:28.520
then I won't stop you.

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:34.070
You're still a child, after all.

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:38.580
Of course you would want a future.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.660
...we'll all eat ramen together!

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:50.220
...you did well.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.510
I'm glad you survived...

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.360
Taiyou?

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:16.230
Something wrong with the closet?

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.120
Pyanepsion!

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:26.250
It's shaped like it was at first?

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:28.850
Is this the one that hasn't 
been defeated once?!

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:31.230
Either Animus or Maimakterion.

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:34.180
Either one of them would come up with this!

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:35.630
Hiding it in my own home!

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:43.760
T-Taiyou! Are you going 
to defeat that thing?!

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:59.050
That technique...

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:02.120
But you can't form a spear very well.

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:05.080
Then, I'll just keep doing it!

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:37.860
You look a lot more manly now, Akane Taiyou.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:40.520
Anima?! How long?

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:44.100
Well done, destroying one 
of Animus' three Celestial Bodies.

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:46.280
Three Celestial Bodies?

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:47.830
I'll grant you a reward.

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:49.070
Don't move.

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:52.630
Huh? Um...

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:57.580
Lo—?!

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:03.380
What's this?!

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:07.420
The Mythic Beast Knight, Hresvelgr.

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:10.890
And another special bonus.

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:17.680
Babies are able to see the golems.

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:22.930
You were this child's first 
sight of a man fighting.

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:56.470
Animus...

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:02.740
You defeated Pyanepsion.

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:05.280
Behold this form, Animus.

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:08.700
We've earned Anima's favor 
and obtained more power.

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.950
Yeah, good work.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:13.770
Come on, don't get so tense.

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:16.420
I told you it's okay 
to defeat the golems, right?

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:20.570
Think you'll fit in with the 
Beast Knights a little better now?

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:22.900
Then keep up the good work.

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:29.470
Why did you defeat Pyanepsion?

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:30.920
I don't know.

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:32.470
It just happened.

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:36.450
I don't have any idea 
what it is I want to do.

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:39.140
How could I know?

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:50.650
Hello?

00:21:50.650 --> 00:21:51.770
<i>Akane-kun?</i>

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:53.100
<i>It's Sorano.</i>

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:55.720
<i>I heard from Subaru-chan and Yuki-chan.</i>

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:58.290
<i>Your power can heal wounds?</i>

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:01.070
<i>That's why you were looking 
at me earlier, wasn't it?</i>

00:22:02.430 --> 00:22:05.630
<i>But don't let what happened 
to Tarou-kun bother you.</i>

00:22:07.100 --> 00:22:11.330
<i>You didn't understand your 
own power at the time, right?</i>

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:12.420
<i>Besides...</i>

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:15.450
<i>He really died instantly.</i>

00:22:20.250 --> 00:22:22.660
<i>Yeah, sorry, that's all.</i>

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:24.030
<i>See you later.</i>

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:31.570
<b>The Furious
Ocean, a 
Biography!!</b>

00:22:41.310 --> 00:22:44.190
Have whatever dream you'd like, Taiyou.

00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:47.850
You're free.

00:24:22.480 --> 00:24:27.480
<b>Next Episode:
Amamiya Yuuhi and Shinonome Hangetsu</b>
